# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Downloads gerados pelo build (instalador/portátil - >100MB)
# Escritos por electron/scripts/publish-installer.js
# ------------------------------------------------------------
web/src/assets/download/*
!web/src/assets/download/README.md
# The application installers are build output and stay out; the two plugin
# archives are source the site links to, a few kilobytes each, and a clone that
# did not carry them would serve a menu whose last two entries 404.
!web/src/assets/download/simple-vlog-editor-claude.zip
!web/src/assets/download/simple-vlog-editor-codex.zip
web/dist/browser/assets/download/
electron/vendor/ffprobe/win32-x64/avcodec-63.dll 
